---
title: "LegionAddressRegistry"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_auth_set: caller invokes setLegionAddress(id, addr)
    q_check_auth_set --> q_revert_auth: caller is not owner
    q_revert_auth --> [*]: revert Unauthorized
    q_check_auth_set --> q_validate: caller is owner
    q_validate --> q_revert_zero: addr == address(0)
    q_revert_zero --> [*]: revert ZeroAddress
    q_validate --> q_store: addr != address(0)
    q_store --> [*]: registry[id] = addr; emit AddressUpdated(id, addr)

    note right of q_store
        INV-001: Only owner can update registry entries
        INV-002: Zero address not allowed as registry value
        INV-003: Registry centralizes all Legion infrastructure addresses
        INV-004: Sale contracts reference registry via syncLegionAddresses
    end note
